"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":16,"created_at":"2025-01-23T17:27:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T01:16:44Z","closed_at":"2025-03-18T19:48:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-18T19:48:55Z"},"body":"AFAIK godot has a long standing issue that its binary size is too big for web platform which leads to slow starup time. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68647 for more details. I profile the binary size a bit with [SizeBench](https://github.com/microsoft/SizeBench) and apply several suggestions.\r\n\r\nWhat I have done:\r\n- no inline `String::~String()`(\\~-5MB), `StringName:~StringName`(\\~-1MB), `_err_print_error`(\\~-200KB)\r\n- Make `_FORCE_INLINE_` a no-op.\r\n- ~remove unused `virtual` qualifier for `Object::call_const` (\\~-10KB) (I wonder if this can be automated, some of these functions are configuration-dependent, e.g. `Object::setvar()` overriden on web but not on Windows. Manually doing this is time-consuming and prone to errors.)(These unused virtuals waste approximately 2.8MB of space in total.)~\r\n\r\nThese changes are guarded by a `SIZE_EXTRA` macro and can be enabled by passing `optimize=size_extra` from cmd.\r\n\r\nResult(Web Release):\r\ncompile with `scons p=web target=template_release optimize=size_extra production=yes`\r\n- godot.wasm\r\n    - master 41,664,454 bytes\r\n    - this PR 30,784,747 bytes\r\n- the whole zip package\r\n    - master 9,421,090 bytes\r\n    - this PR 8,706,984 bytes\r\n\r\nPerformance impact: 5%~10%, measured by godot-benchmark exported to web. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101964#issuecomment-2613820912","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101964/reactions","total_count":28,"+1":13,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":9,"eyes":6},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101964/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}